  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Introduced Amazon SimpleDB export functionality enabling domain data export to S3 in JSON format. Added three new APIs StartDomainExport, GetExport, and ListExports via SimpleDBv2 service. Supports cross-region exports and KMS encryption.",
